ow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10.153ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 4487.7 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">Al</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1233,-235.4) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1636.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(2025.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">SO</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1233,-235.4) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(3662.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(422,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></strong></p></p>\n<p><p>Dissociates into 2 Al<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.232ex\" height=\"1.885ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -833.2 986.7 833.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-n